# Access Control for Models Zenka - Cube User
# Allows cube zenka (message router) to access all models commands

# Core model query commands
get_model find_models recommend

# Invocation tracking
record_invocation

# Statistics and analysis
statistics cost_analysis

# Discovery
discover list

# Management commands
status reload maintenance

# These permissions allow:
# - Other zenka to query models via cube
# - Billing systems to track model usage
# - Optimization systems to analyze costs
# - Future specialized zenka to request recommendations

